    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy &amp; Transparency</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_content"><![CDATA[<b>Data Collection:</b> Flux does not collect, transmit, or store any personal data. Your usage habits stay on your device.<br/><br/><b>Local Processing:</b> All app usage tracking is performed locally on your device using Android\'s standard UsageStats APIs. This data never leaves your device.<br/><br/><b>Permissions:</b> Flux requires Usage Access to calculate friction delays and enforce intentionality.<br/><br/><b>Security:</b> No servers, no cloud, no tracking. Your data is as secure as your physical device.]]></string>
